##############################################################################
# fraternal — Fraternal Orders and Sororities Ontology  —  v1.1.0
#
# Specialises membership for organisations bound together by initiation, ritual and
# graded degrees: fraternal orders, lodges, college fraternities, sororities,
# co-ed and adoptive orders, and orders in the chivalric style. Orders of
# chivalry, genuine and self-styled, are also described here as organisations of
# their members; whether an order is genuine is recorded as a dated assessment
# by someone (fraternal:LegitimacyAssessment), never as a bare fact.
# Gender-neutral throughout; the member title (brother, sister, sibling …) is a
# property of the order, not of the model.
##############################################################################

